#: ../../builtins/time-complexity.rst:5
msgid "Time complexity of operations on built-in types"
msgstr "内置类型各操作的时间复杂度"

#: ../../builtins/time-complexity.rst:7
msgid "This page documents the time complexity of various operations on built-in types in CPython. Other Python implementations may have different performance characteristics. Additionally, the listed costs assume exact built-in types, as instances of subclasses may have different costs."
msgstr "本页记录 CPython 中各种内置类型操作的时间复杂度。其他 Python 实现的性能特征可能不同。此外，所列开销都是针对精确的内置类型而言的，因为子类的实例可能具有不同的开销。"

#: ../../builtins/time-complexity.rst:12
msgid "We use |big O notation|_ to describe how the running time of an operation grows with the size of its inputs. Unless stated otherwise, *n* denotes the number of elements currently in the container, and *k* is the value of a numeric parameter, such as an index or a repeat count."
msgstr "我们用 |big O notation|_ 来描述一个操作的运行时间如何随其输入规模增长。除非另有说明，*n* 表示容器中当前元素的个数，*k* 是某个数值参数的值，例如索引或重复次数。"

#: ../../builtins/time-complexity.rst:22
msgid ":class:`!list`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../builtins/time-complexity.rst:24
msgid "Lists are mutable sequences; for more detail on the implementation see :ref:`how-are-lists-implemented`. The largest costs come from growing beyond the current allocation size (because everything must move), or from inserting or deleting somewhere near the beginning (because everything after that must move). If you need to add or remove at both ends, consider using a :class:`collections.deque` instead."
msgstr "列表是可变序列；关于实现的更多细节参见 :ref:`how-are-lists-implemented`。开销最大的两种情况是：超出当前分配大小之后扩容（因为所有元素都必须移动），以及在靠近开头的位置插入或删除（因为其后的所有元素都必须移动）。如果需要在两端增删，请考虑改用 :class:`collections.deque`。"

