#: ../../builtins/time-complexity.rst:189
msgid ":class:`str` and :class:`bytes` objects are immutable sequences of characters and bytes, respectively. As with tuples, copying one returns the original object. A :class:`bytearray` is mutable, and additionally supports the mutating operations of :class:`list` (except :meth:`!sort`), at the same costs. However, deleting at the front with ``del`` (``del b[0]``, ``del b[:k]``) only advances the start of the buffer instead of moving the remaining bytes, and is amortized *O*\\ (1)."
msgstr ":class:`str` 与 :class:`bytes` 对象分别是字符与字节的不可变序列。与元组一样，复制其中之一个都返回原对象。:class:`bytearray` 是可变的，并额外支持 :class:`list` 的原地修改操作（:meth:`!sort` 除外），开销相同。不过用 ``del`` 在头部删除（``del b[0]``、``del b[:k]``）只是把缓冲区起点前移，而不移动其余字节，属于摊还 *O*\\ (1)。"

